              _a_u_t_o___m_s_g_m_n_i was 1.

              Since Linux 3.19, the content of this file has  no  effect  (be‐
              cause  _m_s_g_m_n_i  defaults to near the maximum value possible), and
              reads from this file always return the value "0".

